# Coinbase Developer Documentation

- [Docs (527 pages)](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/_llms/docs.txt): GET STARTED, AI AGENTS, WALLETS, PAYMENTS, STABLECOINS, TRADING, ONCHAIN TOOLS, CUSTOMERS, WEBHOOKS, CONSUMER APIS, BUSINESS APIS, INSTITUTIONAL APIS.
- [API Reference (918 pages)](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/_llms/api-reference.txt): CDP API, Coinbase Advanced Trade API, Coinbase Business API, Coinbase Exchange API, Coinbase International Exchange API, Coinbase Prime API, CDE: Futures API, CDE: Predictions API, CBC: Clearing API, CDP API V1.
- [SDKs (1523 pages)](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/_llms/sdks.txt): SDKs, CRYPTO INFRASTRUCTURE, COINBASE APIs, INSTITUTIONAL APIs, COINBASE WALLET.

## Recipes

### Integration guides

- [Settle customer stablecoins as USD](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/recipes/settle-customer-stablecoins-as-usd.md): Accept customer USDC, auto-convert it to USD, and collect it in your treasury, with the CDP CLI or SDK.
- [Pay out USDC from a USD balance](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/recipes/pay-out-usdc-from-usd.md): Fund a USD treasury and pay out USDC onchain to any wallet, with the CDP CLI or SDK.

### Recipes

- [Learn by building](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/learn.md): Browse tutorials, demo apps, and projects from the onchain community.
- [Explore](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/explore.md): Jumpstart your building journey with ready-to-use demo apps.
- [CDP YouTube](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/resources/cdp-youtube.md)

#### App examples

##### Wallets

- [Demo App Tutorial](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/wallets/demos/demo-app-tutorial.md)
- [Aave Lending](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/app-examples/aave-lending.md): Enable users to earn yield by depositing into Aave from your onchain app.
- [Morpho Integration](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/app-examples/morpho-integration.md): Enable users to earn yield by depositing into a Morpho vault from your onchain app.
- [Mass Payments](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/app-examples/automated-mass-payouts.md): Build a scalable mass payments application using CDP non-custodial wallets
- [Tempo Integration](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/wallets/demos/tempo.md)
- [Gelato Integration](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/wallets/demos/gelato-integration.md)

##### Onramp

- [Onramp mobile and web demo apps](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/starter/onramp-demo-app.md)

##### Data & Analytics

- [Transaction History Downloader](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/app-examples/transaction-history-downloader.md): A Python tool that downloads complete transaction history for any wallet address, including native transfers and token movements (ERC20/ERC721/ERC1155).
- [Wallet History](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/app-examples/wallet-history.md): A wallet history tool, ready to be deployed to Vercel.

##### Staking API

- [Staking Demo App](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/app-examples/partial-and-full-staking-app.md): A partial and full ETH staking app powered by our fully self-serviceable Staking API with no gated onboarding.
- [Using Go SDK](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/get-started/demo-apps/starter/staking-demo-app.md)

