- [Cancel Entity Futures Sweep](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/prime-api/rest-api/futures/create-entity-futures-sweep.md): Cancel the pending sweep for a given entity. A user will only be able to have one pending sweep at a time. If the sweep is not found, a 404 will be returned. Note: Exchange clients accessing this endpoint as a Cross-Margin customer, must pass their designated Exchange UUID as the *entity_id* path pa…
- [Edit Order (Beta)](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/prime-api/rest-api/orders/edit-order-beta.md): Edit an open order.
